                                                "text": "collateral damage"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6aca19b2-f150-4f75-839e-42a91a8530d5",
                                                "sense_id": "efae36b6-6b34-3df2-8b38-648f8c6ed748",
                                                "text": "Although not a direct cause, the border skirmish was certainly a collateral incitement for the war."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "54c1b4c2-0039-4427-9116-80c026dced0f",
                                                "sense_id": "efae36b6-6b34-3df2-8b38-648f8c6ed748",
                                                "text": "That he [Atterbury] was altogether in the wrong on the main question, and on all the collateral questions springing out of it, […] is true."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
